OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying largely dry with sunny
OL,6,Fspells, but windy. The odd shower may
OL,7,Faffect northern parts for a time.
OL,8,FStrong winds throughout the day, with
OL,9,Fcoastal gales. The wind starts to ease
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear and dry to start the
OL,13,Fnight. Clouding over later, with light
OL,14,Frain across western parts by Monday
OL,15,Fmorning. The wind gradually eases to a
OL,16,Fgentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
