OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRain soon moves in to affect
OL,6,Fmost parts by late morning. Becoming
OL,7,Fdry but remaining cloudy later in the
OL,8,Fafternoon as the rain clears. Turning
OL,9,Fbreezy, especially along coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,12,Fwith rain and showers Tuesday morning,
OL,13,Fclearing later. Mostly dry on
OL,14,FWednesday, with the wind easing during
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Foggy Thursday morning,
OL,16,Fwith brighter conditions later and
OL,17,Flighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
